Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means....
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.81,0:00:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to marry Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.53,0:00:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doraemon! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.70,0:00:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}. Did it went well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This ain't the time for sleep-talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,BIg news!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I thought so!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Just leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(000,300)}W-WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.43,0:00:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.47,0:00:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Tell me it's true... Really, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.69,0:00:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Congrats! I'm so happy for you!